# nomabo

Ma bibliothèque Python.

## Installation

```bash
pip install git+https://github.com/ton-nom/nomabo.git
```

## Utilisation

```python
from nomabo import saluer, aire_cercle

print(saluer("Marie"))
print(aire_cercle(2))
```
